{"name":"The Core Sign","slug":"glyph-core-sign","blurb":"On the depth street, Cress carries the sign toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Core. Click the sign and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Core Sign.","seal":"7d72b15763667825c1fa340d69019dd9ff68c55eb70ace7f2a2e7db40ba945bd"}
